{"content":{"attachment":{"filename":"/Users/evintunador/.claude/projects/-Users-evintunador-repos-evintunador-conversation-ledger/memory/project-annals-extraction.md","snippet":"1\t---\n2\tname: project-annals-extraction\n3\tdescription: \"annals package extracted from cledger (2026-09-01) — store layer as content-agnostic git-notes record library; cledger 0.26.0 sits on it; ev1 history to be wiped, not migrated\"\n4\tmetadata: \n5\t  node_type: memory\n6\t  type: project\n7\t  originSessionId: a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87\n8\t  modified: 2026-09-01T22:57:03.822Z\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t2026-09-01: extracted cledger's storage layer into a new sibling package\n12\t**`annals`** (`~/repos/evintunador/annals`, name confirmed free on npm; user\n13\tpicked it over git-ledger). Grew out of reviewing the (retired)\n14\t`design/extension-governance` branch: rather than governing third-party\n15\tkinds inside cledger, the store became its own layer and vocabularies\n16\tvalidate themselves.\n17\t\n18\tKey decisions:\n19\t- Envelope (producer-blind, per user direction 2026-09-07): schema\n20\t  `annals/v1`, ids `ev2-`, `stream` {id, seq, parent}; **no actor** and\n21\t  producer is just {tool, version} — all vocabulary metadata (actor,\n22\t  source, model, provider, session_id) rides in **`meta`**, which is\n23\t  identity-EXCLUDED (enrich provenance without re-minting ids) and\n24\t  redaction-walked. Identity = {schema, kind, occurred_at, stream,\n25\t  media_type, content, links}. cledger keeps its old flat shape as a view:\n26\t  src/schema.ts toAnnals/fromAnnals fold meta both ways, so adapters/CLI/\n27\t  turnbridge are unchanged. Size policy: limits.warnEventBytes (5MB warn)\n28\t  / maxEventBytes (opt-in refuse). Identity-as-records (git-bug style,\n29\t  links rel authored_by) documented as optional pattern, not built.\n30\t  Third-party kinds identified by `(producer.tool, kind)`; the store\n31\t  validates the envelope only — no registry.\n32\t- **Namespaces**: every op takes a `Ledger` (RepoInfo + NamespaceConfig)\n33\t  from `openLedger()`; a namespace picks notes ref, state dir, config file,\n34\t  cliName, and the pre-push hook invocation. cledger's namespace keeps all\n35\t  old names (refs/notes/conversation-ledger, .cledger.json, ~/.config/\n36\t  cledger). Separate refs are for future producers ([[project-ledger-ecosystem]]:\n37\t  intent-recall wants its own wipeable ref per its D13).\n38\t- ReadOptions gained `tool`, `kind: string|string[]`, `linkRel`;\n39\t  `conversation` filter renamed `stream`.","type":"edited_text_file"},"injection_type":"attachment/edited_text_file"},"context":{"branch":"annals-extraction","cwd":"/Users/evintunador/repos/evintunador/conversation-ledger","head":"d822870bf6a1f6bc481e56557deffd2045a36202","repo":"git@github.com:evintunador/conversation-ledger.git"},"id":"ev2-d10fe9158c78fa11d688a3c266fed0c5b4157c974de6275a4b2cc0d8805bb819","kind":"context_injection","meta":{"actor":{"type":"system"},"session_id":"a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87","source":"claude-code","source_version":"2.1.263"},"occurred_at":"2026-09-07T23:51:38.855Z","producer":{"tool":"cledger","version":"0.26.0"},"raw":{"data":{"attachment":{"filename":"/Users/evintunador/.claude/projects/-Users-evintunador-repos-evintunador-conversation-ledger/memory/project-annals-extraction.md","snippet":"1\t---\n2\tname: project-annals-extraction\n3\tdescription: \"annals package extracted from cledger (2026-09-01) — store layer as content-agnostic git-notes record library; cledger 0.26.0 sits on it; ev1 history to be wiped, not migrated\"\n4\tmetadata: \n5\t  node_type: memory\n6\t  type: project\n7\t  originSessionId: a044dbb5-5e38-4400-bb2a-97061ee33f87\n8\t  modified: 2026-09-01T22:57:03.822Z\n9\t---\n10\t\n11\t2026-09-01: extracted cledger's storage layer into a new sibling package\n12\t**`annals`** (`~/repos/evintunador/annals`, name confirmed free on npm; user\n13\tpicked it over git-ledger). Grew out of reviewing the (ret